            <ArticleTitle>Adipose Tissue Hypoxia, Inflammation, and Fibrosis in Obese Insulin-Sensitive and Obese Insulin-Resistant Subjects.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1422-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1210/jc.2015-4125</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We confirmed fat hypoxia in obese as compared to lean subjects. However, fat oxygenation was similar in obese insulin sensitive and insulin resistant subjects suggesting fat hypoxia may be simply a consequence of fat expansion.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
